  <h2>Follow the detour without losing the destination</h2>
  <p>Because I have ADHD, it's normal for another task to come up while I'm working. I use AI to save a checkpoint: what I've finished, what still needs checking, and exactly where to resume. Then I can work on the new task without pretending the first one disappeared.</p>
  <p>We'll share the prompts and examples as they are checked against real project work. <a href="/about/">Read more about why this matters to me →</a></p>
